ess we we find things  that are enjoyable to do or we persuade  ourselves that this is worthwhile doing  this is what i want to be doing now so  that the process is enjoyable all of  these things are motivating  if we are frustrated by the difficulties  frustrated by our obvious  uh you know  problems in the language  which are part and parcel of learning it  because if we knew the language and made  no mistakes and understood everything  then we wouldn't need to learn it so  because we're learning it we are in fact  encountering these difficulties but we  can find a way to enjoy these  difficulties if we set our minds to it  so  those are sort of my main thoughts on on  motivation another thing that comes up  from time to time is  if you've been studying the same bit of  content and you kind of think you should  be doing this content because it's the  next level of difficulty but you're not  really interested in the content find  something else because there's a  tremendous  difference if we're interested like  let's say that it's something in the  language you're learning and it relates  to your job or relates to a sport that  you're interested in and skiing or  something and all of a sudden it's  interesting i mean that level of focus  that we can achieve when we have content  that's genuinely interesting you know is  is so much stronger that pull the  resonance is so much stronger than where  if we're studying something that we feel  we should study and we're kind of  pushing ourselves and forcing ourselves  so  make sure in order to maintain motiva  motivation that you work with content  that has some value to you either  because and i find myself very motivated  to listen to my mini stories over and  over again but at the same time  find things that are interesting so that  all of a sudden from being somewhat  passive and i should really do this you  all of a sudden wow i'm interested in  this and you'll see that you won't even  notice that you're learning the language  you won't even notice that the language  is washing over your brain because  you're pursuing something there that's  of interest to you and that helps with  motivation okay thank you for listening  bye for now

